WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.304
Tiéfo Amoro e Noumoudara.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.656
Noumoudara woni wuro mawɗo yimɓe Tiéfo nder hirnaange Burkina Faso.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.752
Ko ndeen laamiiɗo, Tiéfo Amoro woni ardiiɗo mum haa sahaa 1800.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.400
Goomu daraniiɗo to Bobo-Dioulasso e hitaande 2026 holli mo wonde ardiiɗo Tiéfo sappo e go'o, jibinaaɗo ko e 1840.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.728
E hitaande 1897, Samory Touré yahdi to diiwaan Bobo-Dioulasso.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:47.200
E wiyde kawtal ngal, Tiéfo Amoro hawti e haɓre keewɗe, haa teeŋti noon to Bama e Penni, caggal ɗuum to Noumoudara.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.752
Samory ɗon hawta bee suudu.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.656
Nde nyalnde go'o timmi, o wurtini ngam o holla sembe maako.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:14.256
Mawɗo taariika'en wi'i nder wolde nde'e wi'aay wonde luulndo waɗannoo konu Tiéfo Amoro ɓeydaaki, o yiɗiri maayde haa teeŋti e hokkugo hoore mum.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.792
Min tawi ko go'oto tan woni haala ɓaawo maako, nden kam ɗum wurtinaama bana non.
